              "stdout": "<class 'str'>\n[{\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Best International Schools in Hanoi 2026\", \"url\": \"https://www.tutopiya.com/blog/international-school-fees/best-international-schools-hanoi/\", \"content\": \"**A natural fit for British and Commonwealth families**, and for those targeting UK university admissions. Strong pastoral reputation and close-knit community.\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Hanoi 2026\\n## 1. United Nations International School Hanoi (UNIS)\\n\\nUNIS is widely regarded as Hanoi\\u2019s most academically rigorous international school.\\n\\nUNIS is the natural first choice for families whose priority is IB excellence and an internationally diverse peer environment.\\n\\n## 2. British International School Hanoi (BIS)\\n\\nA natural fit for British and Commonwealth families, and for those targeting UK university admissions.\\n\\n## 3. Concordia International School\\n\\nConcordia is Hanoi\\u2019s leading American curriculum school, accredited by WASC and offering AP courses in upper school. Popular with North American families and those targeting US college admissions.\\n\\nBVIS Hanoi\\n\\nBVIS offers British curriculum at a more accessible price point than BIS, with multiple campuses making it convenient for families across Hanoi.\\n\\nHanoi Academy\\n\\nHanoi Academy offers IB at fees below UNIS, making it the most accessible full-IB option in the city. Strong choice for IB-committed families who want the qualification at a lower price than the top tier.\\n\\nThe ideal choice for French-speaking families.\\n\\n**Location.** Hanoi traffic means school location matters. Tay Ho (West Lake) is the main expat enclave \\u2014 families there tend to prefer UNIS or BIS. Families in other areas may find BVIS campuses more convenient.\\n\\nGlobally mobile \\u2192 UNIS or Hanoi Academy (IB).\", \"page_age\": \"205 days ago\"}, {\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Top Affordable International Schools in Vietnam (2025 Guide)\", \"url\": \"https://blog.doris.school/affordable-international-schools-vietnam\", \"content\": \"The school offers bilingual pathways alongside international programmes, making it a **common choice for families seeking moderate fees**. \\u2026 The smaller campus environment appeals to families seeking a close-knit community.\\n\\n# Top Affordable International Schools in Vietnam (2025 Guide)\\nMany expat families move to Vietnam expecting international school fees to vary by city, curriculum, and campus size. For parents looking for lower annual tuition, there are schools across Ho Chi Minh City, Hanoi, and Da Nang that fall within the affordable range.\\n\\n## Affordable International Schools in Hanoi\\n### St. Paul American School Hanoi\\nSPASH offers an American-style curriculum with English-medium instruction across primary and secondary. The school provides a full K\\u201312 structure with AP options. Fees sit within the mid-range for Hanoi.\\n\\n### Singapore International School (SIS @ Ciputra)\\n\\nThe school offers bilingual pathways alongside international programmes,\n",
